OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FStaying unsettled, with rain bands
OL,7,Fdrifting southeast through the week.
OL,8,FBrighter spells and showers follow,
OL,9,Fheaviest in the north. Often breezy,
OL,10,Fespecially near coasts. Warm at first,
OL,11,Fcooler from Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
